Subject: [PATCH] agent: keep periodic AP metrics out of orchestrator command ownership

The protocol thread temporarily replaced m_cmd with its private metrics event.
The orchestrator could clear that pointer while TLVs were being constructed,
crashing the agent, or have its newer command overwritten by the saved pointer.
Pass event-owned parameters explicitly through the response and TLV builders;
never borrow or restore the orchestrator's current-command slot.

Upstream-Status: Pending

